/*
 * Retail state the front end reads: everything from the title screen to the
 * grid, and the screens the game comes back to between races.
 *
 * This is the largest of these files because the front end is where the
 * player's choices live. Course and car selection, the shop and the paint
 * booth, the pad and NeGcon configuration screens, the prize and promotion
 * arithmetic that runs on the results screen, and the strings the front end
 * prints all sit here together.
 *
 * The order is retail's, which is address order and not subject order, so a
 * symbol's neighbours here mean nothing. Some arrays are longer than the
 * thing they are named for, because retail named an address and the array
 * runs on to the next name; the strings written out one to a line are those.
 */

